<p>
  To install Derrick manually, download the appropriate package for your system from the
  <ExternalLink href="https://github.com/nomatronio/derrick/releases">Derrick releases page</ExternalLink>.
  Derrick is packaged as an archive. After downloading, extract the archive. It is recommended that you move Derrick
  to a directory in your <code>PATH</code> to allow you to execute it from any directory.
</p>

<p>For example:</p>
<p>
  <code class="output">$ mv ~/Downloads/derrick /usr/local/bin/</code>
</p>
